# Public handbook — no proprietary IP

Copyright (c) 2026 Devrecated.

Applies when editing the public handbook (`docs/**`, `autodevelop-docs/**`). **`docs/internal/**` is out of scope** — that tree may hold IP. Never write proprietary material into the public tree. VitePress builds `autodevelop-docs/` only. Do not set `DOCS_HOSTED=1` to include internal. See [docs-access-before-publish](../process/docs-access-before-publish.mdc) and [autodevelop-docs](../process/autodevelop-docs.mdc).

Handbook ≠ marketing site. Public docs use **$10,000 / 25–40 hours** ([professional-voice](professional-voice.mdc)). Offering-sheet packages ($20k / $40k / $60k) belong on `autodevelop-www`, not GitHub Pages.

## Keep out

- Hosted playbook / skill **bodies**. Wrappers stay thin. Do not paste playbooks into docs. Do not link `services/host/skills/**/SKILL.md`.
- Routing internals, `bucket_*` / `kit_*` tool names, how playbooks are selected.
- How to mint or confirm stakeholder mail (`confirm-token.mjs`, `--confirm`) and live allowlist values. High-level “review the draft, then confirm” is already published — stop there.
- More process IP than the published client guide. The four ship phrases (`YES PUSH TO MASTER`, `YES PUSH TO RELEASE`, `DEPLOYED TO STAGING`, `DEPLOYED TO PRODUCTION`) are already on that guide — do not add routing, token minting, or playbook bodies around them, and do not invent a policy that removes those published phrases.
- Operator runbooks (`services/host/docs/`), margin, model spend, absorbed inference, profitability.
- Live instance bindings: board ids, client names, allowlists, Firebase project ids, `.policies/` values, tokens.
- How to reconstruct remote MCP / hosted skill IP.
- Chat asides (“don’t tell the client”). See [no-chat-leak](../process/no-chat-leak.mdc).

## Allowed

What the product is; `npx @devrecated/autodevelop login`; hosted app roles (ticket / business / operator — do not collapse invite models); the published $10k / 25–40 hour line; customer-facing CLI; high-level gates without extra process IP.

```md
<!-- BAD -->
Run confirm-token.mjs then send-stakeholder-mail.mjs --confirm <token>.
See services/host/skills/…/SKILL.md. bucket_message selects the playbooks.

<!-- GOOD -->
Review to, subject, body-as-text, and ticket link. Confirm the draft. Hooks never send mail.
```
